 	<p n="1-4"><gap reason="lost"/> offered to Vraḥ Svāmī, a pious act of <gap reason="lost"/> <supplied reason="subaudible">Servants</supplied> fit for manual labor <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>ghoda</foreign></supplied>: Vā Vrau. Female <supplied reason="subaudible">Servants</supplied>:  <gap reason="lost"/>, 1 pair of uncastrated animal <gap reason="lost"/></p>
